{"unit_id":"Nothree-code__review-quote-sh#card-zh","repo":"Nothree-code/review-quote-sh","commit":"842a5a651913a54458eda271281dc0f933132705","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"review-quote-sh 是面向 DSH Web 的对话评审与引用插件。在助手消息操作区加入审查和引用入口，并在输入框上方显示引用胶囊。它可按所选范围调用一个或多个已配置模型审查代码或普通回复，支持重答对比、长内容压缩、报告汇总、审查历史和多轮设置。适合希望在对话中复核回答或代码、整理多模型意见并带引用继续提问的 DSH Web 用户。使用时需要 DSH 已配置可用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:629-690","lib/client.js:1150-1175","lib/index.js:215-269"]}
{"unit_id":"Nothree-code__review-quote-sh#card-en","repo":"Nothree-code/review-quote-sh","commit":"842a5a651913a54458eda271281dc0f933132705","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"review-quote-sh adds review and Q&A quoting to DSH Web. Users can send code or replies to configured models, choose conversation scope, compare answers, summarize reports, and revisit reviews. Quote chips place selected Q&A in the composer for follow-up questions. A configured DSH model is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:629-690","lib/client.js:1150-1175","lib/index.js:215-269"]}
