{"unit_id":"Nothree-code__review-quote-sh#feature-3","repo":"Nothree-code/review-quote-sh","commit":"842a5a651913a54458eda271281dc0f933132705","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-quote-sh 的功能「引用问答胶囊」：点击助手消息的引用按钮，把该问答的标记放进输入草稿；输入框上方可展开查看全文，也可移除引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:690-721","lib/client.js:724-768"]}
{"unit_id":"Nothree-code__review-quote-sh#feature-4","repo":"Nothree-code/review-quote-sh","commit":"842a5a651913a54458eda271281dc0f933132705","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-quote-sh 的功能「审查偏好设置」：设置页允许调整审查轮数、每轮模型与思考强度、总结模型及重答对比开关，并可保存或恢复默认值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:387-455","lib/client.js:1167-1175"]}
{"unit_id":"Nothree-code__review-quote-sh#caveat-1","repo":"Nothree-code/review-quote-sh","commit":"842a5a651913a54458eda271281dc0f933132705","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"review-quote-sh 会把所选对话内容和问题交给用户选择的 DSH 模型提供方进行审查；较长内容先经模型压缩，提交前应确认所选文本适合发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136-143","lib/index.js:215-253"]}
